  _landmarkId: borobudur-tapinagi
  _displayTitle: "Borobudur Tap\u0131na\u011F\u0131"
  _shortDescription: "9. y\xFCzy\u0131lda in\u015Fa edilen Borobudur, basamakl\u0131
    teraslar\u0131 dev bir Budist mandalas\u0131 gibi y\xFCkselen an\u0131tsal bir
    tap\u0131nakt\u0131r. Y\xFCzlerce Buda heykeli ve anlat\u0131 kabartmas\u0131,
    ziyaret\xE7iyi sembolik bir ayd\u0131nlanma yolculu\u011Funa \xE7\u0131kar\u0131r.
    Zirveye yak\u0131n \xFC\xE7 dairesel terasta, i\xE7lerinde Buda heykelleri bulunan
    72 delikli stupa ana kubbeyi \xE7evreler."
  _sector: Cava / ENDONEZYA
